  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: (134 – 13) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 11.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 6 and 13\n\nGiven: (134 – 13) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**134 – 6**__) ÷ 27 × 3 – 13 = 11\n\n⇒ __**128 ÷ 27 × 3**__ – 13 = 11\n\n⇒ __**14.22 – 13**__ = 11\n\n⇒ 1.22 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 3 and 6\n\nGiven: (134 – 13) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**134 – 13**__) ÷ 27 × 6 – 3 = 11\n\n⇒ __**121 ÷ 27 × 6**__ – 3 = 11\n\n⇒ __**26.89 – 3**__ = 11\n\n⇒ 23.89 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) 27 and 11**\n\nGiven: (134 – 13) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**134 – 13**__) ÷ 11 × 3 – 6 = 27\n\n⇒ __**121 ÷ 11**__ × 3 – 6 = 27\n\n⇒ __**11 × 3**__ – 6 = 27\n\n⇒ __33____ - 6__ = 27\n\n⇒ **27 = 27**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) 11 and 13\n\nGiven: (134 – 13) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**134 – 11**__) ÷ 27 × 3 – 6 = 13\n\n⇒ __**123 ÷ 27**__ × 3 – 6 = 13\n\n⇒ __**123 ÷ 27 × 3**__ – 6 = 13\n\n⇒ __13.67 - 6__ = 13\n\n⇒ 7.67 ≠ 13\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
